{"id":"n55534-1-9","stage":1,"title":"메시지 · 信息","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55534-1-9-1","ko":"특별히 전하실 메시지라도 있으신가요?","zh":"有什么特别要转达的消息吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"특별히","meaning":"特别，特意","explanation":"특별히：特别，特意","readings":[{"term":"특별히","audio":"/audio/40c40953510f5fbfdc0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71298","senseId":"1","lemma":"특별히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전하실","meaning":"转达","explanation":"전하다：转达；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"전하다","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75767","senseId":"4","lemma":"전하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"메시지라도","meaning":"信息，通告，寄语","explanation":"메시지：信息，通告，寄语；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"메시지","audio":"/audio/4cd44bae95c4239c79a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55534","senseId":"1","lemma":"메시지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있으신가요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ가요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"40c40953510f5fbf","term":"특별히","zh":"特别，特意","audio":"/audio/40c40953510f5fbfdc0f.mp3","entryId":"71298","definition":"与众不同地。","pronunciation":["특뼐히"]},{"id":"4adf4bd60c3c1626","term":"전하다","zh":"转达","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3","entryId":"75767","definition":"将消息、想法等告知对方。","pronunciation":["전하다"]},{"id":"4cd44bae95c4239c","term":"메시지","zh":"信息，通告，寄语","audio":"/audio/4cd44bae95c4239c79a2.mp3","entryId":"55534","definition":"为了通知、主张或警告某件事情而特地传达的消息。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/468810246ba7c8dbd886.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55534-1-9-2","ko":"제가 없는 사이에 아이들을 잘 돌봐 주세요.","zh":"我不在的时候，请帮帮我好好照顾孩子们。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는","meaning":"不在","explanation":"없다：不在；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"7","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사이에","meaning":"间，之间，……的时候","explanation":"사이：间，之间，……的时候；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사이","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61187","senseId":"2","lemma":"사이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이들을","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌봐","meaning":"照顾，照看","explanation":"돌보다：照顾，照看；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"돌보다","audio":"/audio/bb6524970702f93b5ae2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61310","senseId":"1","lemma":"돌보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不在","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人、事物、现象等不占据某处或空间。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"01aa8d172f6fe0b5","term":"사이","zh":"间，之间，……的时候","audio":"/audio/01aa8d172f6fe0b5d3b5.mp3","entryId":"61187","definition":"从某一时刻到另一个时刻的时间。","pronunciation":["사이"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bb6524970702f93b","term":"돌보다","zh":"照顾，照看","audio":"/audio/bb6524970702f93b5ae2.mp3","entryId":"61310","definition":"对某个对象关心并保护照顾。","pronunciation":["돌ː보다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/213fada0b913dadf7b75.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.487,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=55534","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.2123,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我不在的时候，请帮帮我好好照顾孩子们。","婚礼决定请谁证婚？","有什么特别要转达的消息吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我不在的时候，请帮帮我好好照顾孩子们。","有什么特别要转达的消息吗？","婚礼决定请谁证婚？"],"answer":0}]}
